Description: 4k Intro by Ye Olde Laptops Posse & s.k.o.y.p, released in 2017
 4k Intro by Ye Olde Laptops Posse & s.k.o.y.p, ranked 5th in the
 PC 4k compo at Evoke 2017.
 .
 Code by provod, music by keen (4klang synthesizer).
 .
 The 4klang synthesizer is written in 32-bit x86 assembly, so the
 intro is only built for i386.
